{"id":"wb-4-128","name":"大高玄殿","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"大高玄殿","text":"大高玄殿，又称大高元殿，简称高玄殿、大高殿，是一座明清两代皇家御用道观，主祀三清、玉帝，位于北京市西城区景山前街北侧。因大高玄殿临街的头道山门是并排的三座门，故此地地名又俗称“三座门”。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E9%AB%98%E7%8E%84%E6%AE%BF","revisionId":85848131,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85848131","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8bdbe235256fc627381651ed.jpg","title":"大高玄殿大门.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A4%A7%E9%AB%98%E7%8E%84%E6%AE%BF%E5%A4%A7%E9%97%A8.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/48/%E5%A4%A7%E9%AB%98%E7%8E%84%E6%AE%BF%E5%A4%A7%E9%97%A8.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Sgsg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​大高玄殿大门","width":320,"height":204}}